                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On July 24, 1950, Secretary of State Acheson appeared in executive session before
                    the Senate Foreign Relations Committee. He discussed the world situation in
                    light of the outbreak of the Korean War. For the record of his testimony, see
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Reviews of the World Situation, 1949–1950: Hearings
                        Held in Executive Session Before the Committee on Foreign Relations, United
                        States Senate</hi> (81st Cong., 1st and 2nd sessions), pages 313–337.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
